{
  "song_id": 31456,
  "title": "Ode to Road Rage",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Yolk 'em, leave 'em with his feet danglin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Got his degree in stranglin' and street hagglin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You could find 'em on the beat braggin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Then discreetly draggin' MCs towards the meat wagon",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And they chicks to the bang bus",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Make 'em kick and slang cuss, to Vik it's no dang fuss",
          "rhyme": "os",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "He sense a trickle of lingering hate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "But refused to get tickled by the fickle finger of fate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "\"Fuck that nigga!\"",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Vik, in it for the buck by the giga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "A short truck ride to the liquor store to refuel",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Rookie at the counter, manager told 'em, \"He cool\" (You got some change?)",
          "rhyme": "ul",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Walk, tellin' your hard luck story",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Or else that's gonna leave a scar, yuck gory",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "And we're Audi (peewwmm!) V and his rowdy crew",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You could see how loud he blew and now that's a fine howdy doo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABCDEEFFGGHHIJ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAABCDEEEEFFGGFD"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Sclerrrrr! Stay in your lane!",
          "rhyme": "an",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Keep drivin' straight or catch a stray in your brain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Go deep divin' off the side of the bridge off a slide and a skid",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Who wanna ride with the kid?",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCC",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Tryna live to see old age",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "So he roll with the loaded gauge, ode to road rage (Road rage)",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Better get up off his bumper",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Before he get dumber and let off the thumper",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Yeah take the next exit",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Catch 'em on the back street, clack the heat but forget it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "That's one less butt face",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "News lady said they found coke, open and shut case",
          "rhyme": "az",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "They convinced it's drug related",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "V skated off in the ugly buggy faded",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "After that last turn, seen an old man crash and burn",
          "rhyme": "9Rn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "They have to place his ashes in an urn",
          "rhyme": "9Rn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "In return the world is a safer place to race",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Just don't invade his personal space",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Worst case scenario",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "They should back away from the bass that's in the stereo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Insurance can't bring you back to life",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "From a pissy drunk driver when a big rig jack knife",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABBCCDEFFGGDDHHII",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCCAADDBBAAEEAA"
    },
